@startuml RBM_Standby
!theme plain
title RBM_Standby Sequence Diagram

participant ":SC_1412_ADISS" as ADISS
participant ":SC_1420_SDS_RDC" as RDC
participant ":SC_1430_SDSOM" as SDSOM
participant ":rbm_api_interface" as RBM

note over RBM
Ring Buffer Manager waits for
the command to start buffering data
end note

== RBM StandBy: ADISS ==

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_CleanPartition()
RBM --> ADISS: RBM_ok()

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_GetVersion()
RBM --> ADISS: Version Info()

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_GetState()
RBM --> ADISS: RBM_Standby()

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_AddMetaData()
RBM --> ADISS: RBM_ok()

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_DeleteEntryADISS()
RBM --> ADISS: RBM_ok()

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_ReqCbk()
RBM --> ADISS: Callback(RBM_StorSize)

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_StartBuffering()
RBM --> ADISS: RBM_ok()
RBM --> ADISS: Callback(RBM_StateChange : RBM_Buffering)

note over RBM
Alternatively, ADISS may decide to
request Ring Buffer Manager to go back
to initialization mode.
end note

ADISS -> RBM: RBM_ReInit()
RBM --> ADISS: RBM_ok()
RBM --> ADISS: Callback(RBM_StateChange : RBM_Init)

== RBM StandBy: SDSRC ==

RDC -> RBM: RBM_CleanPartition()
RBM --> RDC: RBM_ok()

RDC -> RBM: RBM_GetVersion()
RBM --> RDC: Version Info()

RDC -> RBM: RBM_GetState()
RBM --> RDC: RBM_Standby()

RDC -> RBM: RBM_AddMetaData()
RBM --> RDC: RBM_ok()

RDC -> RBM: RBM_DeleteEntryRDC()
RBM --> RDC: RBM_ok()

RDC -> RBM: RBM_ReqCbk()
RBM --> RDC: Callback(RBM_StorSize)

== RBM StandBy: SDSOM ==

SDSOM -> RBM: RBM_GetVersion()
RBM --> SDSOM: Version Info()

SDSOM -> RBM: RBM_GetState()
RBM --> SDSOM: RBM_Standby()

@enduml
